    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652840/extras/66daaa9c189780dd4517992fb9980052.avif?t=1749296220\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLORY, PRESSURE, AND PERFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the cheerleading team of Silverlake, an elite college for the wealthy, as they fight their way to the national championships.<br>At the center stands Elena, a brilliant and ruthless captain whose ambition is matched only by her need to survive. For her, winning isn't just about pride\u2014it's about keeping her scholarship and staying afloat in a world that wasn\u2019t built for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652840/extras/4fd0d636bf232b412a2443360b62279b.avif?t=1749296220\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCIPLINE, SACRIFICE, AND SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the squad trains hard to perfect every move, tensions simmer beneath the surface. Rivalries, betrayals, and hidden agendas threaten to shatter the fragile balance that holds the team together.<br>Every decision counts, every mistake has a price\u2014and not everyone will make it to the final round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652840/extras/a388e32cc21e236d0bcec0623f729c90.avif?t=1749296220\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOICES, RIVALRIES, AND A LOT OF SKIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheerleaders is a mature visual novel with branching choices, flirtation, drama, and power dynamics. Enjoy intimate moments, unexpected twists, and explore how far each girl is ready to go: whether for glory, money, or pleasure. <br>Are you ready to manipulate the team toward your kinks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652840/extras/9a9aa419693337785cbe5e07bba6d399.avif?t=1749296220\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT CHEERLEADERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains suggestive content, mature dialog, and sexually charged scenarios between consenting adults. All characters are over the age of 18.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pom-poms were harmed in the making of this game (but they enjoyed it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652840/extras/962b179c66acd74d3d758843b8eb4cd5.avif?t=1749296220\" width=612 height=220 /></span></p>",
